# Development/CI dependencies: testing, lint, formatting, typing, dependency
# auditing. Never installed into a production image (worker or control-plane).
#
# pytest is pinned to 9.0.3, the fixed release for PYSEC-2026-1845 /
# CVE-2025-71176 (a local tmp-directory naming issue on Unix), matching
# pyproject.toml's `dev` extra. Pytest is test tooling, not part of the
# scientific dependency stack in [project.dependencies]: it has no effect on
# the fetched data, the fitted model, or any committed report, so this pin
# carries no reproducibility risk. The full suite, both marker lanes, Ruff,
# mypy and pip-audit were all re-run clean against 9.0.3 with no regression.
# The others are Phase 0 tooling, left to resolve to their latest compatible
# release.
pytest==9.0.3
