# Test-only, transport-format re-encoding proof (architecture plan Phase 1:
# "dataset_id is invariant to re-encoding (CSV -> Parquet -> CSV)",
# tests/test_artifact_identity.py). Not a worker/control runtime dependency:
# the domain's dataset-identity scheme (scenario_platform.domain.identity)
# hashes DECODED values and never touches Parquet itself, so pyarrow is used
# only inside the test to prove that identity survives round-tripping through
# a transport format genuinely different from CSV -- it does not appear in
# worker.lock or control.lock, and no production code path imports it.
